@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}

<section class="sp-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <h1>About SafeMind</h1>
        <p>Accessible, evidence-based mental health support for everyone.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="sp-body container">

    <p>SafeMind was built with a single mission: to make quality mental health care accessible, affordable, and stigma-free. We believe that everyone deserves support — whether they're navigating everyday stress or working through deeper challenges with a licensed professional.</p>

    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>We connect people with licensed therapists, provide self-guided wellness tools, and offer a private space to track and understand mental health over time. From mood check-ins to structured therapy sessions, SafeMind meets you where you are.</p>

    <h2>What We Offer</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Licensed therapy sessions</strong> – Book one-on-one sessions with verified, licensed mental health professionals.</li>
        <li><strong>Mood &amp; wellness tracking</strong> – Daily check-ins to help you spot patterns and stay connected to how you're feeling.</li>
        <li><strong>Private journaling</strong> – A secure diary for your thoughts, reflections, and goals.</li>
        <li><strong>Mental health articles</strong> – Curated, evidence-based content on anxiety, stress, depression, relationships, and more.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Our Commitment to Privacy</h2>
    <p>We take your privacy seriously. SafeMind complies with HIPAA and follows strict security practices to protect your personal and health information. Learn more on our <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="HipaaCompliance">HIPAA Compliance page</a> and <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
    <p>Have questions or feedback? We'd love to hear from you. <a asp-controller="Contact" asp-action="Index">Contact the SafeMind team.</a></p>

</section>
